    {
      "dom_id": "question-340819",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "$$\nEvaluate $\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$$\n$\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5})=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{csch}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}) & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}}-{e}^{-(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5})}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{(\\sqrt{5})}^{-1}}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{5}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}-\\sqrt{5})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(\\frac{1-5}{\\sqrt{5}})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}})} \\\\  & =2\\times (-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
