      "name": null,
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-\\sqrt{3})=$",
      "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{csch}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-\\sqrt{3}) & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}}-{e}^{-(-\\sqrt{3})}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}}-{e}^{\\sqrt{3}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
