    {
      "dom_id": "question-125371",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-5)=$",
      "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{csch}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-5) & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-5}-{e}^{-(-5)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-5}-{e}^{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
