      "problem": "$$\nEvaluate $\\operatorname{sech}⁡7.$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$$\n$\\operatorname{sech}⁡7=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{sech}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sech}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sech}⁡7 & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{7}+{e}^{-7}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
