      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-96551\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">14.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"96551\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"106\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Which of the following is equivalent to  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"107\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"2\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D464 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>coth</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 2:15 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:22</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
