    {
      "dom_id": "step-31490",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Evaluating Hyperbolic Cotangent",
      "problem": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nEvaluate $\\coth  (-\\ln 3).$",
      "worked_solution": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nThe definition of $\\coth x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{coth}⁡x & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}+1}{{e}^{2x}-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{e}^{-2x}}{1-{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the fourth definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{coth}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3) & =\\frac{1+{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}}{1-{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}{1-{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{3}^{2}}}{1-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{3}^{2}}{1-{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+9}{1-9} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{(-8)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
