    {
      "dom_id": "step-33484",
      "name": "Hyperbolic Cotangent",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/75a56c2d21e2f2cf83a6635933aa5b3b4f4683fedef5f51430d0b1b171d8726b.svg)\n\nThe **hyperbolic cotangent function** (pronounced \"coth\") is defined as \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/a76c7780cd40b24bf3cb5dcd55eecd4c14e4a79825cba1501d4b8afd425405ba.svg)\nThe graph of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/158841441ef667264704ceb47ea5e26bac1385fef070fd7e42ae1527bada9631.svg) is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/d3d4f5cbe846f7725399fa1b1769c4f476be439575043537a2caa80c318a5ec9.png)\n\nNote the following properties of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/d90a56456cf17cffd5fe59547103b45ba1ba186c40060f43e3674e66fcd69434.svg)\n\n- Its domain is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/56c0f97156e3980b9cf25c7204e993714a0879ba463132c958267e5927e71f4c.svg)\n\n- Its range is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/f111c1f23a40b18e1e4baf575183e31bcc8d7987e90a8a16e024c252b61699d3.svg)\n\n- It has a vertical asymptote ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/29da0a4605613d6a7fd9e7bb2f4fb45cbabe8a47109971682844cb222486a20c.svg)\n\n- It has horizontal asymptotes ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/849544fed9b7437b1c0d262b2cf17d4539f767beab6ba7c8a7de82cff4c7ca68.svg)\n\n- It is an odd function.\n\nUsing the alternative definitions of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/0d5fcc991aa44ea723f4c42355e8a876b33441902dfb72ae82d4917ffff1b16b.svg) we can write down two more definitions for ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/944a08f36feb5caee9da43f160c130a4b48b46f5f28fe5be3147a272b600eb74.svg)\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14198821/assets/d26afd4eb7797e35fab8b46d018a646cf1faf02c7ffae9311587754ed210ef31.svg)",
