      "html": "<div id=\"step-33484\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"33484\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"5354\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-33484\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-9\">Hyperbolic Cotangent</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"33484\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.036ex\" height=\"0.036ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The <strong>hyperbolic cotangent function</strong> (pronounced \"coth\") is defined as \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" display=\"true\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.945ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30.633ex\" height=\"5.021ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1359.6 13539.9 2219.2\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,-91.6)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"63\" d=\"M370 305T349 305T313 320T297 358Q297 381 312 396Q317 401 317 402T307 404Q281 408 258 408Q209 408 178 376Q131 329 131 219Q131 137 162 90Q203 29 272 29Q313 29 338 55T374 117Q376 125 379 127T395 129H409Q415 123 415 120Q415 116 411 104T395 71T366 33T318 2T249 -11Q163 -11 99 53T34 214Q34 318 99 383T250 448T370 421T404 357Q404 334 387 320Z\"></path><path data-c=\"6F\" d=\"M28 214Q28 309 93 378T250 448Q340 448 405 380T471 215Q471 120 407 55T250 -10Q153 -10 91 57T28 214ZM250 30Q372 30 372 193V225V250Q372 272 371 288T364 326T348 362T317 390T268 410Q263 411 252